[2025-05-05 13:39:48 | 6818bfa460f1d] cf7pd.INFO: POST - leads {"title":"AD alburaq","owner_id":13601147,"1b6c5556b8f2796d4a87d842248152f78384ac37":"Lead Submitted On: https://alburaq.ae/contact-us/","3a108ee6cdcaad880546876dd524bfa9aa686da7":"My name is Daniel Jimenez, CEO of Belab Services and its subsidiaries. We have a company in UAE dedicated to the registration of cosmetic products and food supplements with MOHAP and Dubai Municipality. We operate with a Trade License without any further problems. We are in the process of expanding to Saudi Arabia with the same company concept, but we find that not all activities allow us to register products with eCOSMA (KSA). Some tell us that we can apply for activities that do not involve having Saudi sodium. Others claim that we need a 25% partner. We are very confused and have been a little dizzy for 3 or 4 months. Could you help us?","4c0ac56cd5cca4ff7d5996b692608d5b82ea9dc6":"Spain (España)","1a6deacde079621009c4acc7d0e0c237a84d3d86":"User Landed on:","person_id":362355}
